{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/pulls/58126","id":4270642240,"node_id":"PR_kwDOABxyKc7-jNRA","html_url":"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/58126","diff_url":"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/58126.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pull/58126.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/issues/58126","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/pulls/58126/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/pulls/58126/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/issues/58126/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/statuses/ff78778b7cde837bcd3128582280f34582522e5f","number":58126,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(buying): allow purchase returns against a closed purchase order","user":{"login":"Pandiyan5273","id":171273338,"node_id":"U_kgDOCjVseg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/171273338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273","html_url":"https://github.com/Pandiyan5273","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pandiyan5273/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Issue:**\r\n- Once a purchase order is closed, you can no longer return any of its remaining items to the supplier.\r\n\r\n**Fixes:** [#58121](https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/issues/58121)\r\n\r\n**Steps to replicate:** \r\n\r\n1. Purchase Order for 2 units → submit.\r\n2. Two Purchase Receipts of 1 unit each → submit both. Order shows To Bill.\r\n3. From the first receipt: Create > Return → submit.\r\n4. On the PO: Status > Close.\r\n5. From the second receipt: Create > Return → Save. This is where it throws Purchase Order PUR-ORD-…  status is Closed.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Before:**\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 2026-08-13 16-47-25.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfe8d5f4-2e21-4f55-84ed-dd97126271e9)\r\n\r\n**After:**\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 2026-08-13 16-51-11.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d3cdd75d-db7b-4431-9fa3-764d3a69febe)\r\n\r\n\r\n**Actual behaviour:**\r\n\r\nThe system refuses to save the return and says the order is closed.\r\n\r\n**Expected behaviour:**\r\n\r\nThe return should save, because customer returns already work this way on closed sales orders.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Backport Needed For V15 and V16**","labels":[{"id":594501200,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1OTQ1MDEyMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/labels/buying","name":"buying","description":null,"color":"e99695","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6108602236,"node_id":"LA_kwDOABxyKc8AAAABbBnffA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/labels/backport%20version-15-hotfix","name":"backport version-15-hotfix","description":"","color":"9852C8","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":9674745981,"node_id":"LA_kwDOABxyKc8AAAACQKjofQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frappe/erpnext/labels/backport%20version-16-hotfix","name":"backport version-16-hotfix","description":"","color":"1d76db","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-13T11:22:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-13T12:25:42Z","closed_at":"2026